<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2 { text-align: center; font-weight: bold; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  td { padding: 8px 0; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div>
    <!-- Logo Placeholder -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <!-- Assuming a logo placeholder here -->
    </div>
    <h2 style="text-align: center;">STUDENT ACCESSIBILITY SERVICES</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: small;">
      <span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span> •
      <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span> •
      <span data-field="fax">{{ fax }}</span> •
      <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span>
    </p>

    <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">NOTE TAKER VERIFICATION</h1>

    <p>Instructions: This form is required to be filled out and scanned to <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span> or faxed to <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span> within the first week of class.</p>

    <table>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Student Name:</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="student_name">{{ student_name }}</span></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">ID #:</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Note Taker Name:</td>
        <td><span data-field="note_taker_name">{{ note_taker_name }}</span></td>
        <td>ID #:</td>
        <td><span data-field="note_taker_id">{{ note_taker_id }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Instructor Name:</td>
        <td><span data-field="instructor_name">{{ instructor_name }}</span></td>
        <td>Class #:</td>
        <td><span data-field="class_number">{{ class_number }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Course:</td>
        <td><span data-field="course_name">{{ course_name }}</span></td>
        <td>Class Start Date:</td>
        <td><span data-field="class_start_date">{{ class_start_date }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <h2 style="text-align: center;">STUDENT VERIFICATION</h2>

    <div style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 20px;">
      <p>By signing below, I agree to the above named student taking notes for me for the above referenced course. I further agree to notify the Academic Accommodations Coordinator at <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span> if I drop this class and I understand that I am not entitled to notes taken for me for classes that I do not attend.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 60px;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          Signature:
          <div class="signature-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          Date:
          <div class="signature-line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div>
    <h2 style="text-align: center;">NOTE TAKER VERIFICATION</h2>

    <div style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 20px;">
      <p>By signing below, I agree to take notes for the above named student for the above referenced course. I further agree to notify the Academic Accommodations Coordinator at <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span> if I drop this class or am not able to carry out this duty. I agree to be present at each scheduled class; if I will not be present, I agree to notify the above named student in advance so that he or she may make alternate arrangements.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 60px;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          Signature:
          <div class="signature-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          Date:
          <div class="signature-line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: small;">
      *** Please note: If you have any questions regarding note taking services, please contact the Academic Accommodations Coordinator at <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span>. The note taker's account will be credited 10 days after the class end date if the completed form is received in the Central Business Office on that date. If you have any questions regarding payment to your student account, contact Student Business Services at <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span>. ***
    </p>
  </div>
</div>